{# A small group of photos pinned up together, two to four prints taped and
   overlapping, for a set that belongs together: three internships, one
   experiment from three angles, a pair of posters. Bigger sets stay in
   .gallery. Each print opens the shared lightbox.

   Set collagePhotos (list of slugs) before including. Optional:
     collageWide   — 4:3 prints instead of 3:4
     collageArt    — prints keep their own proportions (posters, artwork)
     collage2up    — four prints as a block of two by two, not a row of four
     collageCredit — a line under the group (who made it, what it is) #}
<div class="collage{% if collageWide %} collage--wide{% endif %}{% if collageArt %} collage--art{% endif %}{% if collage2up %} collage--2up{% endif %}">
  {% for slug in collagePhotos %}{% photo slug, "", "(min-width: 900px) 260px, 44vw" %}{% endfor %}
</div>
{% if collageCredit %}<p class="collage__credit">{{ collageCredit | safe }}</p>{% endif %}
{% set collageWide = false %}{% set collageArt = false %}{% set collage2up = false %}{% set collageCredit = "" %}
